From 78d9e53f43c4040cdb4cc1e16d1301341ef2fad5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:30:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(H6): bind analyze UI to H1/H5 API contract with real
 gates

Align types and PetAnalyze/DrugRanking/Dosage/Recipe adapters to
backend recommendations/score and PharmacistDrugEntry fields. Add
vitest contract tests plus tsc typecheck that fail on ranked_drugs,
fit_score, quarantine_drugs, and truncated panels.
